@startuml User_Journey_Admin_Content
!theme blueprint
title Cramer CMS - Admin Content Creation Journey\n(From AI Generation to Published Test)

skinparam {
    BackgroundColor #1a1a2e
    TitleFontColor #ffffff
    TitleFontSize 18
    DefaultFontColor #e8e8e8
    ArrowColor #64b5f6
    NoteBackgroundColor #424242
    NoteFontColor #ffffff
    ActivityBackgroundColor #37474f
    ActivityBorderColor #78909c
}

|#2c3e50|Content Planning|
start
:Admin wants to create new Reading test;
note right
  **Content Goal:**
  - Target: IELTS Academic
  - Topic: Climate Change
  - 3 passages, 40 questions
  - Mix of question types
end note

:Logs into Admin panel (/admin);
:Reviews existing content;
:Identifies gap: No climate-focused tests;

|#34495e|Test Set Setup|
:Navigates to Content > Sets;
:Creates new Test Set;
:Name: "Cramer Original - Climate";
:Saves test set;

:Opens Set Detail page;
:No tests yet - empty state;
:Clicks "Tao bai moi";

:Creates Test #1;

|#9b59b6|AI Content Generation|
:Opens AI Studio (/admin/content/generate);
:Selects skill: Reading;
:Chooses parts: 1, 2, 3;

:Configures Part 1:
- Topic: "Global Warming Effects"
- Question types: TRUE/FALSE/NOT GIVEN
- 13 questions;

:Configures Part 2:
- Topic: "Renewable Energy Solutions"
- Question types: MATCHING_HEADINGS
- 13 questions;

:Configures Part 3:
- Topic: "Carbon Capture Technology"
- Question types: MULTIPLE_CHOICE
- 14 questions;

:Selects AI model: DeepSeek V3;
:Enables reasoning tokens;
:Clicks "Bat dau tao";

|#3498db|Generation Process|
:Watches SSE streaming;
note right
  **Real-time Display:**
  - AI reasoning steps visible
  - Passage generating...
  - Questions generating...
  - Progress bar: 0% -> 100%
end note

:Part 1 complete (2 minutes);
:Part 2 complete (2 minutes);
:Part 3 complete (2 minutes);
:Total generation: ~6 minutes;

|#f39c12|Quality Review|
:Views generated content in Preview;
:Checks passages for:
- Accuracy
- Appropriate difficulty
- Paragraph structure;

:Checks questions for:
- Correct numbering (1-40)
- Answer validity
- Option clarity;

:Sees validation issues:
- Q12 answer not in passage
- Q27 missing option;

|#e74c3c|Refinement|
:Selects issues to fix;
:Clicks "Sua loi voi AI";
:Agent 2 generates patches;
:Applies automatic fixes;

:Re-validates content;
:All issues resolved!;

|#27ae60|Save & Edit|
:Clicks "Luu vao he thong";
:Selects target test set;
:Selects target test;
:Saves to database;

:Opens Test Editor;
:Fine-tunes manually:
- Adjusts passage wording
- Fixes typo in Q15
- Updates answer explanation;

|#1abc9c|Audio Recording (Listening)|
partition "If Listening Test" {
  :Opens Audio section;
  :Uploads pre-recorded audio files;
  :Maps audio to sections;
  :Sets transcript text;
}

|#9b59b6|Final Review|
:Enables Admin Preview;
:Takes test as student would;
:Checks timer behavior;
:Verifies answer checking;

:All looks good!;

|#27ae60|Publishing|
:Changes status to "Published";
:Confirms publish action;
:Test now visible to students!;

note right
  **Published Test:**
  - Appears in course list
  - Students can attempt
  - Analytics tracking begins
end note

|#34495e|Monitoring|
:Returns to Admin Dashboard;
:Watches test metrics:
- First attempts coming in
- Average scores: 28/40
- Completion rate: 85%;

:Content creation successful!;
stop

legend right
  **Admin Journey Metrics:**
  |= Phase |= Time |
  | Planning | 5 min |
  | Setup | 3 min |
  | AI Generation | 6 min |
  | Review | 10 min |
  | Refinement | 3 min |
  | Manual Editing | 15 min |
  | Final Review | 10 min |
  | **Total** | **~52 min** |
endlegend

@enduml
